  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      656.14,
      538.34,
      709.78
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, North-central province and in Monaragala, Puttalam, Hambantota, Trincomalee and Mannar districts.",
